Error [E3412]: `core.net.tcp_connect()` is not available at comptime yet
  --> tests/ui/impure_net_stub.jet:6:29
    |
  6 |         comptime conn = net.tcp_connect("build.example.com:443")
    |                             ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: network access at compile time requires a fetch mechanism with content-hash pinning, which is pending an owner decision
 Fix: use `embed_file` or `embed_bytes` for local build-time data; track D-NETDEP1 in Tower for network support
